-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/h.gif\" width=\"30\">ISTORY(</b>by<b>\n</b></span></font><font color=\"#3333FF\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>SIRL</b></span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>)</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">와이번은 \n            드레이크와 비슷한 크기를 지닌 몬스터로 드래곤과 아주 흡사하다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이들은 \n            날개와 두발을 가졌고, 날카로운 이빨이 촘촘히 박혀있는 입은 악어처럼 \n            길며, </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">박쥐와 \n            같은 날개가 있고 끝이 뽀족한 꼬리를 가지고 있다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이들의 \n            크기는 드레이크 정도이다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이들은 \n            특별히 무서운 점은 없지만 그들의 독특한 꼬리는 전갈처럼 독을 가지고 \n            있는데 이 독은 상당히 강하여 많은 여행자들을 죽음에 이르게 만든다. \n            마법을 쓰지 못하므로 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">마법사들의 \n            소환하는 블레이드 스피릿을 디스펠 하지 못한다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:120%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:2; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Comment \n                                        by </span></font><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Pink</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;: \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"470\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"26\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/pink.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"65\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:40/65\" width=\"40\"></b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"424\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">브레스를 뿜지는 못하지만 굉장히 강력한 독을 근접 전투전에서 사용하므로 </span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">치료포션을 준비해두면 유용하다. </span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">드레이크보다 약하며 이 와이번은 \n예전에 기사단들이 타고다닌적도 있다. <br>마법에 대한 저항력이 약해서 6서클이상의 마법을 마스터한 마법사는 쉽게 잡을수 있다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">항간에 \n들리는 소문에 의하면 전갈의 변형이라는 말도 있지만 아직 확인된 바는 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">없으므로 접어두기로 하겠다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이것은 드레이크나 드래곤과는 달리 \n테임이 되지 않아 의문점이 제기되기도 한다. <br>아마도 그들의 유독 강한 자존심때문이라고 생각된다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\